.Dd January 21, 2024
.Dt RZ_SIGN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm rz-sign
.Nd rizin signature utility
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm rz-sign
.Op Fl aqv
.Op Fl e Ar k=v
.Op Fl c Ar output.pat Ar input.sig
.Op Fl o Ar output.sig Ar input.bin
.Op Fl d Ar flirt.sig
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm rz-sign
creates and inspects FLIRT code signatures.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl a
Analyze binary after loading (use
.Fl aa
for deeper analysis)
.It Fl c Ar output.pat Ar input.sig
Dump FLIRT signature to pattern format
.It Fl d Ar flirt.sig
Parse FLIRT signature file
.It Fl e Ar k=v
Set evaluable config variable
.It Fl h
Show usage help
.It Fl o Ar output.sig Ar input.bin
Generate FLIRT signatures
.It Fl q
Quiet mode
.It Fl v
Show version information
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rz-asm 1 ,
.Xr rz-ax 1 ,
.Xr rz-bin 1 ,
.Xr rz-diff 1 ,
.Xr rz-find 1 ,
.Xr rz-gg 1 ,
.Xr rz-hash 1 ,
.Xr rz-run 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An pancake
